    "canonicalUrl": "https://quasar.dev/vue-components/knob",
    "content": "The QKnob component is used to take a number input from the user through mouse/touch panning. It is based on [QCircularProgress](/vue-components/circular-progress) and inherits all its properties and behavior.\n\nAPI reference: QKnob",
